{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonies x Grand Strategy</h2>Fusing the intuitive management of Colony-Build games with the clear competitive stakes and vast scale of Grand Strategy.<br>Dive into diverse breakthrough tactics:<br>Early Rush \u2022 Cultural Expansion \u2022 Trade/Slavery \u2022 Migration \u2022 Enforce other tribes to tribute or become your vassal.<br>Combine these approaches, restarting to conquer new paths after each victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/b874ab5b1d4b1d83184a85eec4b6c6df.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cAncient Nations Competition\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>We added simple grand strategy gameplay to colony-building mechanics.<br>You will lead a branch of \u200cAncient Chinese, starting by building a small tribe: crafting tools, constructing houses, hunting, farming, and raising livestock.<br>Then face 5 ethnic groups in Asia: \u200cRongdi, Baiyue, Ancient Chinese States, Aryans, Assyrians\u200c.<br>From the eastern Yellow River basin to Mesopotamia \u2013 rule or be ruled.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/064879fa3c090d525ce366d2e2b61fdb.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cTech Tree &amp; Culture Tree\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>You can develop culture to make other tribes submit, pay tribute, and provide \u200cvassal troops + supplies\u200c.<br>Or gain advanced tools and bronze through technological advantage for trade.<br>Or prioritize reproduction through \u200cfertility worship\u200c.<br>Or embrace violence, train professional soldiers, and plunder extensively.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/51f9fd6e93bda9c71aeaf415b064bdfd.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cManage Slaves\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Force lifelong labor, OR adopt them into your tribe to bear children.<br>Execute slaves to suppress rebellions, OR sell them directly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/6cf153c037c5f1841d261b27ad6343b3.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cLeaders &amp; Grouping\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Use Leaders to manage groups, reducing repetitive actions.<br>Set group schedules: labor, create culture, develop tech, or train.<br>Battlefield controls function like traditional RTS unit groups.<br>Future update: Group leaders will become a higher social class.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/dc29fb1c287388e230d24fe201b58dd2.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cKnowledge Inheritance\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Tribesmen gain knowledge through labor \u2013 lost when they die.<br>Must carve knowledge onto stone monuments to preserve it.<br>These monuments become learning tools for future generations.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1876880?t=1755659575","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1876880?t=1755659575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/ba4d92f1598bc151d9c3f50df3ac1f1736918fb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755659575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/ba4d92f1598bc151d9c3f50df3ac1f1736918fb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755659575","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonies x Grand Strategy</h2>Fusing the intuitive management of Colony-Build games with the clear competitive stakes and vast scale of Grand Strategy.<br>Dive into diverse breakthrough tactics:<br>Early Rush \u2022 Cultural Expansion \u2022 Trade/Slavery \u2022 Migration \u2022 Enforce other tribes to tribute or become your vassal.<br>Combine these approaches, restarting to conquer new paths after each victory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/b874ab5b1d4b1d83184a85eec4b6c6df.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cAncient Nations Competition\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>We added simple grand strategy gameplay to colony-building mechanics.<br>You will lead a branch of \u200cAncient Chinese, starting by building a small tribe: crafting tools, constructing houses, hunting, farming, and raising livestock.<br>Then face 5 ethnic groups in Asia: \u200cRongdi, Baiyue, Ancient Chinese States, Aryans, Assyrians\u200c.<br>From the eastern Yellow River basin to Mesopotamia \u2013 rule or be ruled.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/064879fa3c090d525ce366d2e2b61fdb.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cTech Tree &amp; Culture Tree\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>You can develop culture to make other tribes submit, pay tribute, and provide \u200cvassal troops + supplies\u200c.<br>Or gain advanced tools and bronze through technological advantage for trade.<br>Or prioritize reproduction through \u200cfertility worship\u200c.<br>Or embrace violence, train professional soldiers, and plunder extensively.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/51f9fd6e93bda9c71aeaf415b064bdfd.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cManage Slaves\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Force lifelong labor, OR adopt them into your tribe to bear children.<br>Execute slaves to suppress rebellions, OR sell them directly.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/6cf153c037c5f1841d261b27ad6343b3.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cLeaders &amp; Grouping\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Use Leaders to manage groups, reducing repetitive actions.<br>Set group schedules: labor, create culture, develop tech, or train.<br>Battlefield controls function like traditional RTS unit groups.<br>Future update: Group leaders will become a higher social class.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/extras/dc29fb1c287388e230d24fe201b58dd2.webp?t=1755659575\" alt=\"\u200cKnowledge Inheritance\u200c\" width=606 height=46 /></span><br>Tribesmen gain knowledge through labor \u2013 lost when they die.<br>Must carve knowledge onto stone monuments to preserve it.<br>These monuments become learning tools for future generations.","developers":["YSH BigDove"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1876880/e5f4f4d4a65fc95f04d101b869e4a663428ae363/header.jpg?t=1755659575","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1876880/1590868575/20112d87599b0da7d95280c9d58e0d2f993633a8/1755237804/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755242159","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1876880/1590868575/20112d87599b0da7d95280c9d58e0d2f993633a8/1755237804/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755242159","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1876880/1590868575/20112d87